@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-44 - View Stock Movements

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Admin Inventory UI" as FE
control "InventoryController" as API
control "InventoryService" as Service
database "MongoDB: shoesDetail, stockMovements" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-44
FE -> API: GET /inventory/overview
API -> Service: Execute View Stock Movements
Service -> DB: Read/write shoesDetail, stockMovements
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Lịch sử stock movements hiển thị

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã có stock adjustments
Post: Lịch sử stock movements hiển thị
Main flow:
1. Admin vào tab Stock Movements
2. System gọi API GET /inventory/movements/:productId
3. System trả về: timestamp, type (IN/OUT/ADJUST), quantity, reason, userId
4. Hiển thị audit trail
end note
@enduml
